{
  "name": "Telegram Bot Commands",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message"
        ]
      },
      "id": "telegram-trigger",
      "name": "Telegram Bot Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 300],
      "webhookId": "telegram-bot"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.message.text }}",
              "operation": "startsWith",
              "value2": "/"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "filter-commands",
      "name": "Filter Commands Only",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [470, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Parse Telegram command\nconst message = $input.first().json.message;\nconst text = message.text || '';\nconst chatId = message.chat.id;\nconst username = message.from.username || 'user';\n\n// Extract command and arguments\nconst parts = text.split(' ');\nconst command = parts[0].replace('/', '').toLowerCase();\nconst args = parts.slice(1);\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    command: command,\n    args: args,\n    chatId: chatId,\n    username: username,\n    fullText: text,\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "parse-command",
      "name": "Parse Command",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [690, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "rules",
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "string": [
                  {
                    "value1": "={{ $json.command }}",
                    "value2": "start"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "outputKey": "start"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "string": [
                  {
                    "value1": "={{ $json.command }}",
                    "value2": "help"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "outputKey": "help"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "string": [
                  {
                    "value1": "={{ $json.command }}",
                    "value2": "balance"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "outputKey": "balance"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "string": [
                  {
                    "value1": "={{ $json.command }}",
                    "value2": "portfolio"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "outputKey": "portfolio"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "string": [
                  {
                    "value1": "={{ $json.command }}",
                    "value2": "analyze"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "outputKey": "analyze"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "string": [
                  {
                    "value1": "={{ $json.command }}",
                    "value2": "topup"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "outputKey": "topup"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "route-command",
      "name": "Route Command",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [910, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chatId }}",
        "text": "=🎉 *Selamat Datang di Cuanterus Bot!*\n\nBot trading assistant untuk membantu analisis saham dan manage portfolio.\n\n📱 *Perintah yang tersedia:*\n/help - Daftar perintah\n/balance - Cek saldo RDN\n/portfolio - Lihat portfolio holdings\n/analyze BBCA - Analisis saham\n/topup 1000000 - Top-up saldo\n\n💡 Ketik /help untuk info lebih lengkap!\n\n🚀 Powered by n8n + Claude AI",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "id": "cmd-start",
      "name": "CMD: /start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1130, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chatId }}",
        "text": "=📖 *Daftar Perintah Cuanterus Bot*\n\n*Portfolio Management:*\n/balance - Cek saldo RDN Anda\n/portfolio - Lihat semua holdings\n/topup [amount] - Top-up saldo RDN\n\n*Stock Analysis:*\n/analyze [SYMBOL] - Analisis saham (contoh: /analyze BBCA)\n\n*Information:*\n/start - Pesan sambutan\n/help - Daftar perintah ini\n\n*Contoh Penggunaan:*\n• `/analyze BBRI` - Analisis Bank BRI\n• `/topup 5000000` - Top-up Rp 5 juta\n• `/balance` - Cek saldo saat ini\n\n💡 Tip: Perintah tidak case-sensitive!",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "id": "cmd-help",
      "name": "CMD: /help",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1130, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.FRONTEND_WEBHOOK_URL }}/api/balance",
        "authentication": "none",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "get-balance-data",
      "name": "Get Balance Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [1130, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $node[\"Parse Command\"].json.chatId }}",
        "text": "=💰 *Saldo RDN Anda*\n\nSaldo: *Rp {{ $json.balance.toLocaleString('id-ID') }}*\n\n📊 Status: {{ $json.balance > 1000000 ? '✅ Siap trading!' : '⚠️ Saldo menipis, top-up yuk!' }}\n\n💡 Ketik /topup untuk isi saldo",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "id": "send-balance",
      "name": "Send Balance",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1350, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.FRONTEND_WEBHOOK_URL }}/api/holdings",
        "authentication": "none",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "get-portfolio-data",
      "name": "Get Portfolio Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [1130, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const holdings = $input.first().json.holdings || [];\nconst chatId = $node[\"Parse Command\"].json.chatId;\n\nif (holdings.length === 0) {\n  return {\n    json: {\n      chatId: chatId,\n      message: \"📂 *Portfolio Anda Kosong*\\n\\nBelum ada holdings. Mulai trading yuk!\\n\\n💡 Gunakan /analyze untuk cari saham bagus!\"\n    }\n  };\n}\n\n// Calculate totals\nconst totalValue = holdings.reduce((sum, h) => sum + h.totalValue, 0);\nconst totalPL = holdings.reduce((sum, h) => sum + h.plAmount, 0);\nconst avgPL = (totalPL / totalValue) * 100;\n\n// Build holdings list\nlet holdingsList = holdings.map((h, i) => {\n  const plEmoji = h.plAmount > 0 ? '📈' : '📉';\n  return `${i + 1}. ${plEmoji} *${h.symbol}*\\n   ├ ${h.lots} lot @ Rp ${h.avgPrice.toLocaleString('id-ID')}\\n   ├ P/L: ${h.plPercent.toFixed(2)}% (Rp ${Math.abs(h.plAmount).toLocaleString('id-ID')})\\n   └ Value: Rp ${h.totalValue.toLocaleString('id-ID')}`;\n}).join('\\n\\n');\n\nconst message = `📊 *Portfolio Holdings*\\n\\n${holdingsList}\\n\\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\\n💰 Total Value: *Rp ${totalValue.toLocaleString('id-ID')}*\\n📈 Total P/L: *${avgPL.toFixed(2)}%* (Rp ${Math.abs(totalPL).toLocaleString('id-ID')})\\n\\n${totalPL > 0 ? '🎉 Lagi cuan nih bosku!' : '💪 Sabar, market lagi sideways!'}`;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    chatId: chatId,\n    message: message\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "format-portfolio",
      "name": "Format Portfolio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1350, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chatId }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.message }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "id": "send-portfolio",
      "name": "Send Portfolio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1570, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const args = $input.first().json.args;\nconst chatId = $input.first().json.chatId;\n\nif (args.length === 0) {\n  return {\n    json: {\n      error: true,\n      chatId: chatId,\n      message: \"⚠️ *Format Salah*\\n\\nGunakan: `/analyze [SYMBOL]`\\n\\nContoh:\\n• /analyze BBCA\\n• /analyze BBRI\\n• /analyze TLKM\"\n    }\n  };\n}\n\nconst symbol = args[0].toUpperCase();\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    error: false,\n    chatId: chatId,\n    symbol: symbol,\n    message: `🔍 Sedang menganalisis *${symbol}*...\\n\\n⏳ Tunggu sebentar ya bosku!`\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "parse-analyze",
      "name": "Parse Analyze Args",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1130, 500]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chatId }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.message }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "id": "send-analyze-wait",
      "name": "Send Analyze Wait",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1350, 500]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const args = $input.first().json.args;\nconst chatId = $input.first().json.chatId;\n\nif (args.length === 0) {\n  return {\n    json: {\n      error: true,\n      chatId: chatId,\n      message: \"⚠️ *Format Salah*\\n\\nGunakan: `/topup [JUMLAH]`\\n\\nContoh:\\n• /topup 1000000 (Rp 1 juta)\\n• /topup 5000000 (Rp 5 juta)\"\n    }\n  };\n}\n\nconst amount = parseInt(args[0]);\n\nif (isNaN(amount) || amount <= 0) {\n  return {\n    json: {\n      error: true,\n      chatId: chatId,\n      message: \"❌ *Jumlah Tidak Valid*\\n\\nMasukkan angka yang benar!\\n\\nContoh: /topup 1000000\"\n    }\n  };\n}\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    error: false,\n    chatId: chatId,\n    amount: amount,\n    method: 'Telegram Bot'\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "parse-topup",
      "name": "Parse Top-up Args",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1130, 600]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.FRONTEND_WEBHOOK_URL }}/api/webhook/balance",
        "authentication": "none",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ {\n  \"source\": \"telegram\",\n  \"timestamp\": $now.toISO(),\n  \"data\": {\n    \"action\": \"topup\",\n    \"amount\": $json.amount,\n    \"method\": \"Telegram Bot\",\n    \"notes\": \"Top-up via Telegram @\" + $node[\"Parse Command\"].json.username\n  }\n} }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "send-topup-webhook",
      "name": "Send Top-up Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [1350, 600]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $node[\"Parse Top-up Args\"].json.chatId }}",
        "text": "=✅ *Top-up Berhasil!*\n\n💰 Jumlah: *Rp {{ $node[\"Parse Top-up Args\"].json.amount.toLocaleString('id-ID') }}*\n\n📊 Saldo baru sudah masuk ke RDN Anda!\n\n💡 Ketik /balance untuk cek saldo terbaru",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "id": "send-topup-success",
      "name": "Send Top-up Success",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1570, 600]
    }
